Usage: ruralz dev run [DIR] [FLAGS]

Local ruralzd with Hot Reload.

Arguments:
  DIR  Bundle directory or one-file Bundle (default .)

Flags:
  --env NAME                Environment to render with (needs --environments)
  --environments FILE       Local Environment resources
  --ephemeral-ports         Replace every port with a free one
  --help                    Print this help
  --output text|json        Output format (text or json, default text)
  --ready-timeout DURATION  How long to wait for /readyz (default 30s)
  --secret-overrides FILE   Local files replacing secretRefs
